     "explain": "Say 你好 to greet one person, 你们好 to greet several, 您好 to be polite. Answer 对不起 with 没关系.",
     "pattern": "你好！ / 对不起！— 没关系！",
     "examples": [
      {
       "text": "你好！",
       "pron": "Nǐ hǎo!",
       "meaning": "Hello!"
      },
      {
       "text": "您好！",
       "pron": "Nín hǎo!",
       "meaning": "Hello! (polite)"
      },
      {
       "text": "对不起！— 没关系！",
       "pron": "Duìbuqǐ! — Méi guānxi!",
       "meaning": "Sorry! — That's OK!"
      }
     ],
     "requires": []
    }
   ]
